The [[Hero Sword]] is a [[weapon]] attained by combining the [[Wooden Sword]] with a [[Whetstone]]. It gives touching weapons +1 damage at start of battle. It's not a particularly impressive weapon on its own (though, much better than the [[Wooden Sword]]), but does craft into a number of stronger weapons, and also the [[Steel Goobert]].

